  m_text: 'Hi there, little alien!

    I''m Ice


    Don''t worry, I''m totally
    harmless.

    I''m not your enemy... I just think you''re going a little too
    fast.

    Touch me and I''ll give you a little break.

    I only freeze those
    who rush.

    <i>For your own good, of course.</i>


    <size=80%>No need to
    thank me.</size>'
